From 0191e11b3a8ba066a5ee041e172e8ba51a5b9df5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evan Thomas <evan@evanjt.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:34:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] winebth.sys, bluetoothapis, windows.devices.bluetooth:
 Add Bluetooth LE GATT support.

Import the Bluetooth LE work from evanjt/wine (commit e0b31bc), written
for Rouvy: GATT discovery, read/write and notifications in winebth.sys
and bluetoothapis, plus the WinRT BluetoothLEAdvertisementWatcher,
BluetoothLEDevice and GattDeviceService/GattCharacteristic classes in
windows.devices.bluetooth. Also add the windows.devices.radios DLL.

This replaces the in-progress upstream GATT code in bluetoothapis and
winebth.sys instead of building on it.

https://github.com/evanjt/wine
Ported to GE-Proton by David Szendrei.
